1
00:00:01,110 --> 00:00:02,000
To'xta!

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,250
«Siz yutdingiz» degan notanishga SMS kodni hech qachon o'qib berma.

3
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:08,300
Voy! iPhone yutibman!

4
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:10,770
Faqat besh daqiqa vaqt bor ekan.

5
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:14,600
Assalomu alaykum, bankdan bezovta qilyapman.

6
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:15,800
Sizga kod keldi.

7
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:18,060
Shuni ayting, sovg'angizni rasmiylashtiramiz.

8
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:20,800
Hozir, hozir...

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,710
Kodni aytishdan oldin, SMSni menga ovoz chiqarib o'qi.

10
00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:28,900
Telegram kodi...

11
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:32,700
«Bu kodni hech kimga bermang»...

12
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:35,900
Bu sovg'a kodi emas.

13
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,920
Bu sening Telegramingning kaliti.

14
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:41,450
Kalitni bersang, eshikni o'zing ochib berasan.

15
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:44,880
Ular sovg'a bermaydi.

16
00:00:45,350 --> 00:00:49,040
Sening nomingdan yaqinlaringdan pul so'rashadi.

17
00:00:50,730 --> 00:00:51,600
Uchta belgi.

18
00:00:52,470 --> 00:00:54,050
Tanlovda qatnashmagansan.

19
00:00:54,940 --> 00:00:56,000
Shoshiltirishyapti.

20
00:00:56,930 --> 00:00:57,870
Kod so'rashyapti.

21
00:00:58,870 --> 00:01:00,970
Uchalasi bo'lsa, bu tuzoq.

22
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:03,400
Go'shakni qo'y.

23
00:01:03,820 --> 00:01:06,420
Bankka o'zing rasmiy raqamdan qo'ng'iroq qil.

24
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:08,840
Telegramda bulutli parolni yoq:

25
00:01:09,290 --> 00:01:11,230
kodni bilib olishsa ham, kira olmaydi.

26
00:01:12,850 --> 00:01:14,700
Besh daqiqa tugadi.

27
00:01:15,350 --> 00:01:16,740
Men esa hech narsa yo'qotmadim.

28
00:01:17,350 --> 00:01:22,650
Haqiqiy sovg'a senga hech qachon kod so'ratmaydi.

29
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:25,160
Shubhali xabar keldimi?

30
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:28,730
Skrinshotini botimizga yuboring: @sahiychishopbot

31
00:01:28,930 --> 00:01:31,600
Firibgarlikmi yo'qmi, tushuntiradi,

32
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:34,390
bulutli parolni qanday yoqishni bosqichma-bosqich o'rgatadi.

